  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "652d13f16523028c",
      "translationZh": "Basis 构建 AI 智能体来自动化会计师每天进行的许多手动工作，帮助他们将时间从重复性任务转向战略性工作。该公司的研究重点是能够可靠地完成长期任务的智能体，并且通过 GPT-6 Astra，它正看到模型对会计师想要实现的目标有了更强的理解能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fc92976d8a45392",
      "translationZh": "“GPT-6 Astra 在真正理解用户意图和问题方面做得更好。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e1b35cfd81df857",
      "translationZh": "—Mitch Troyanovsky，Basis 联合创始人",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e6152511f3e036c5",
      "translationZh": "用一半的时间完成包含 50 个工作表的税务工作簿",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74ec5e4ce23ca633",
      "translationZh": "Basis 在一个包含 50 个工作表的复杂税务工作簿上对比了 GPT-6 Astra 和 GPT-5.6 Sol。任务是准确且可靠地完成该工作簿，而 GPT-6 Astra 的速度明显更快。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5398632c5d58d8ca",
      "translationZh": "“GPT-6 Astra 完成该工作簿所需的时间仅为 GPT-5.6 Sol 的一半。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1549deba3e57a0d0",
      "translationZh": "Basis 还指出，GPT-6 Astra 在任务开始时能做出更好的决策，帮助 Basis 的智能体以更直接的路径完成工作，从而减少了纠正错误所花费的时间。Troyanovsky 表示，这也使得模型在 Token 使用上更加高效。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eae6b877eab94990",
      "translationZh": "使推理力度与任务相匹配",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
